        <mxCell id="scripts_body" value="• fig2: 31×31 + 31×21, 50k/site, 30w&#xa;• fig3: 9 snaps 0.23-0.95, 512 reps, 25-100M&#xa;  24fps 10s 240 frames H-lerp&#xa;• fig4: 40 β, 100k/site, dJ/dβ&#xa;• fig5: 24 β, 50k/site, bootstrap 200&#xa;• fig6: 30 β ×3 α, 50k/site, 16 reps" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
